{"id":"nacional","lemma":"nacional","pos":"adj","rank":1083,"glosses":["national, nationwide (of or relating to a nation)","national (native to a nation)"],"ipa":"/naθjoˈnal/","forms":{"femininePlural":"nacionales"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/55/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-nacional.wav","examples":[{"text":"Él se volvió un héroe nacional.","en":"He became a national hero.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to return","l":"volver"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"hero"},null]},{"text":"El lunes próximo es fiesta nacional.","en":"Next Monday is a national holiday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/721987","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"Monday"},{"g":"near"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"party"},null]},{"text":"La deuda nacional está aumentando.","en":"The national debt is growing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641871","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"debt"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to increase, grow","l":"aumentar"}]},{"text":"En los feriados nacionales alzamos las banderas.","en":"We put up the flags on national holidays.","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},null,null,null,{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"flag, banner","l":"bandera"}]},{"text":"Está prohibido cazar en los parques nacionales.","en":"Hunting is banned in national parks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553672","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"forbidden"},{"g":"to hunt"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"park","l":"parque"},null]}]}